<name>Грбая · точки похода 22–23.10</name>
<Style id="B"><IconStyle><color>ff84dc3d</color><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/pushpin/wht-pushpin.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style>
